<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's AMP cuts loan rate to 7.47 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's AMP cuts loan rate to 7.47 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Mutual Provident Society (AMP) said on Wednesday it would cut its Priority One &quot;no frills&quot; home mortgage rate to 7.47 percent from 7.98 percent from January 15 next year.</p>
<p>The cut by the insurance and funds management group follows the Reserve Bank of Australia's 50 basis point cut in official cash interest rates to 6.0 percent earlier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
